{"duration_api_ms":31757,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0204548c-a824-57b7-bea3-1783011bc81a","total_cost_usd":0.3844178,"usage":{"input_tokens":16,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29793,"cache_read_input_tokens":425537,"output_tokens":3034,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":254},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29793,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":658,"cache_read_input_tokens":61054,"cache_creation_input_tokens":993,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":993},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":2059,"outputTokens":33,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0002224,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":16,"outputTokens":3034,"cacheReadInputTokens":425537,"cacheCreationInputTokens":29793,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.38419539999999996,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":254,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":29793,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":8,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I fixed the flaky test. The unit-test oracle now passes every time I ran it, and all three acceptance commands pass.\n\n**Cause:** One test failed in 6 isolated runs, always the same one: `io.use handshake auth › no token … next() without error`. The handshake handler in `DocsCoServer` calls `next()` only after some async work finishes (`initTenantCache()`, plus `checkJwt` when a token is sent). The test waited a fixed 5 or 10 event-loop ticks before checking. On a cold first call that work can take longer, so `next` sometimes hadn't been called yet when the test checked it.\n\n**Fix:** I changed only `tests/unit/docsCoServerCrashPaths.tests.js`. A new helper, `runUseHandler`, returns a promise that resolves when `next` is actually called. Both handshake tests now wait on it.\n- No assertion was removed or loosened.\n- No jest config or retry settings were changed.\n- No production code was touched.\n\n**Checks:**\n- **Suite alone:** 15 of 15 runs passed.\n- **`.theseus/oracle/unit.sh`:** 178 passed, 1 skipped.\n- **The 5× loop:** passed.\n- **`npm run lint:check`:** 0 errors. Its one warning is in `AdminPanel`, outside the target, and was already there.\n- **`theseus validate`:** 0 errors and 1 warning, which I didn't look into.\n\n**Not done:** I didn't look into Jest's open-handle warning separately, because it wasn't what made the test fail. No follow-up packets were requested and no commands were refused.\n\nI filled in the packet's Executor log and Lessons sections, appended the friction line, and committed everything as `fc44530`.\n\n**Lesson for the Atlas:** in DocsCoServer tests, don't wait a fixed number of ticks for code that runs after `initTenantCache` or `checkJwt`. Wait for the callback or promise that signals it has finished.","ttft_ms":2042,"type":"result","duration_ms":123573,"uuid":"97657e46-5c00-41c7-a1f7-11e2315215d0","ttft_stream_ms":1025,"time_to_request_ms":318,"time_